## 7. Lifecycle Hooks on the Upstream Hook Engine

All ABB guardrails are **registered hooks on the existing PreToolUse/PostToolUse engine** (C2), matched by tool name + shadow-path pattern. Priorities use upstream's priority ordering.

```mermaid
graph TD
    UserAction["Model calls Edit on tasks/sub/NN_task.md (status -> done)"] --> H1{"PreToolUse: FrontmatterSchemaHook<br/>(matcher: abb_workspace/**/*.md)"}
    H1 -->|"YAML valid, status enum ok (A1)"| H2{"PreToolUse: DAGGateHook<br/>(matcher: tasks/sub|base/*.md)"}
    H1 -->|"Schema violation"| Error1["Reject tool call with remediation message"]
    
    H2 -->|"All depends_on have status=done"| Exec["Edit executes"]
    H2 -->|"Unresolved depends_on"| Error2["Block: list incomplete parent task ids"]
    
    Exec --> H3{"PostToolUse: TwoTrackVerifyHook<br/>(status -> done on sub/*)"}
    H3 -->|"Read verify manifest from STACK.md (A2)"| Verifier["Run Track 1 (unit) + Track 2 (system) via Bash"]
    Verifier -->|"Both tracks green"| H4{"PostToolUse: RollupHook"}
    Verifier -->|"Any failure"| Error3["Revert status, write logs/failure/, demand traceback skill"]
    
    H4 -->|"100% sister subs done"| ClearBase["Auto-set parent base task status=done"]
    H4 -->|"Sisters incomplete"| KeepBase["Base stays in_progress"]
```

### Hook Inventory (all upstream-engine hooks unless noted):
| Hook | Event / Matcher | Action |
|---|---|---|
| `ShadowBootstrapHook` | **SessionStart** (new lifecycle point — verify upstream has one; else run at CLI bootstrap before engine start) | Auto-init shadow workspace; verify template `VERSION` compat (A7). |
| `ABBPromptInjectionHook` | SessionStart / prompt assembly | Inject `agent.md` + `router.md` + `STACK.md` digest via upstream prompt assembly. |
| `FrontmatterSchemaHook` | PreToolUse: Write/Edit on `abb_workspace/**/*.md` | Pydantic-validate YAML frontmatter (incl. `status` enum, A1). |
| `DAGGateHook` | PreToolUse: Edit on `tasks/{sub,base}/*.md` | Block `in_progress`/`done` transitions with unsatisfied `depends_on`. |
| `TwoTrackVerifyHook` | PostToolUse: Edit setting subtask `status: done` | Execute verification manifest (A2); revert + log on failure. Interim soft-gate until A2 (C11). |
| `RollupHook` | PostToolUse: after subtask `done` | Auto-complete parent base task at 100%. |
| `DriftDetectionHook` | PostToolUse: Write/Edit on codebase files | Heuristic structural delta vs `references/structure/`, `STACK.md`; full audit via `/drift`. |
| `SkillStagingHook` | PreToolUse: Write on `skills/skills.md` | Enforce `_staging/` purge + index registration (A4). |
| `PreCompactSnapshotHook` | PreCompact (upstream auto-compact event) | Dump topological DAG snapshot into session state so compaction preserves task context. |

