| `/init` | `/i` | No | Runs `init_project.md` wizard (or re-run for STACK refresh). |
| `/route` | `/r` | No | Manually run `router.md` classification on current objective. |
| `/goal` | `/g` | No | Inspect/edit `tasks/goal/goal.md`. |
| `/task` | `/t` | No (upstream `Task*` are tools, not commands) | DAG status view (base/sub tree, blocked/ready). |
| `/verify` | `/v` | No | Manually trigger `work_verification.md` for active subtask. |
| `/drift` | `/d` | No | Run `recheck_codebase.md` audit + report. |
