**Sequencing**: A1 + A2 unblock Phase 1 hooks; A3 unblocks dogfooding correctness; A4 unblocks Phase 2 skill bridge; A5–A7 are cheap and can land anytime in Phase 1. All land on the ABB `codeless` branch first (D4) and are promoted to `main` after dogfood validation, since Codeless itself consumes `main`.

